{"title": "Deflect Missiles (passive feature)", "pageid": 40247, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Deflect_Missiles_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Class features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Deflect_Missiles.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp/300px-Deflect_Missiles.webp, /w/images/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp/300px-Deflect_Missiles.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Deflect Missiles</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monk</a> passive feature that allows them to reduce the damage of an incoming ranged attack and potentially return it to the attacker.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Use your reaction to reduce the damage from a ranged weapon attack by 1d10 + your Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Modifier\">Modifier</a> + your monk level. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles\" title=\"Deflect Missiles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/40px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/60px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/80px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deflect Missiles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp/40px-Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Deflect_Missiles_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles\" title=\"Deflect Missiles\">Deflect Missiles</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles_(Return)\" title=\"Deflect Missiles (Return)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/40px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/60px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/80px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deflect Missiles (Return)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/40px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles_(Return)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect Missiles (Return)\">Deflect Missiles (Return)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monk</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202251\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU ti